  <data key="d17">Paper</data>
  <data key="d18">Single-Crystalline Ultrathin Co3O4 Nanosheets with Massive Vacancy Defects for Enhanced Electrocatalysis</data>
  <data key="d19">Abstract-level source paper on oxygen-vacancy-rich Co3O4 nanosheets for OER.</data>
</node>
